  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.6.0 adds exception-first Try overloads and mixed async/sync pipeline support:\n            - Added Try<T>/TryAsync<T> returning Result<T, Exception> for clean exception logging before transformation\n            - Added TapAsync/TapErrorAsync overloads accepting sync actions with async results\n            - Enables pattern matching on exception types with full exception context\n            - Simplifies async pipelines with sync side effects (no more Task.FromResult wrapping)\n            - Complete separation of logging (TapError) and transformation (MapError)\n            All changes are backwards compatible. No breaking changes.\n            See RELEASE_NOTES_1.6.0.md for full details.",
